stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> RECEIVED
  RECEIVED --> VALIDATING
  VALIDATING --> REJECTED: schema, identity or rule failure
  REJECTED --> RECEIVED: corrected resubmission
  VALIDATING --> ACCEPTED: all controls pass
  ACCEPTED --> CERTIFIED: receipt signed
  CERTIFIED --> POSTED: VAT transaction and ledger committed
  POSTED --> MATCHED: counterpart confirms or deterministic match
  POSTED --> EXCEPTION: missing or inconsistent counterpart
  EXCEPTION --> MATCHED: resolved
  CERTIFIED --> REVERSED: approved cancellation or credit-note chain
  REVERSED --> [*]
  MATCHED --> [*]

